'''Book of Stats''' is an {{Epic}} cosmetic that shows the amount of kills a [[Weapon]] has or the amount of crops a [[Farming Tool]] has harvested.

== Obtaining ==
It can be bought from the [[Bingo#Bingo Shop|Bingo Shop]] for {{Gold|5 Bingo Points}}.

== Usage ==
A '''Book of Stats''' can be applied to any [[Weapon]], including [[Swords]] and [[Bows]], or [[Farming Tool]]. It may be appliable to Wands, Support items and miscellaneous items (E.g. [[Gemstone Gauntlet]]). Once applied, it will start tracking the Weapon's kills or Farming Tool's total crops harvested, displaying in its tooltip.<!--, starting after the Book is applied{{Confirm}}--> <!--The amount of kills on a Weapon will be displayed on its tooltip{{Confirm}}.-->

